{
  "bodyHash": "iAnWPiUOydw=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"289\"></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Overview.png\" alt=\"模組概覽\" width=\"1416\" height=\"114\"></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組無需安裝在伺服器端，僅需客戶端安裝即可運作。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">採集時若快捷欄中有對應工具，會自動切換至正確工具。亦支援其他模組添加的工具。</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若需暫時停用自動切換功能，可按住潛行鍵時破壞方塊。</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">另設有切換開關熱鍵（預設為G鍵）可全局啟用/停用此功能。</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NYH2w773S84?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Automatic_Tool_Swapper/BH_AT_Bisect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"155\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">#廣告 #Ad&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">問題回報與建議請至<a href=\"https://github.com/MelanX/ToolSwap/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>提交。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
